# Wrangler local plaintext secrets (NEVER commit — used by `wrangler dev`).
# Real secrets live in Cloudflare via `wrangler secret put`; see each
# wrangler.jsonc for the list (POSTGRES_URL, GEMINI_API_KEY, AUTH_SECRET, ...).
.dev.vars
.dev.vars.*

